#---------------------------------- Content ---------------------------------#

# Fonts must be created with MGCB Editor or MonoGame Font Builder.
# Place .spritefont XML files here and build.
# Example structure (user creates actual spritefonts):

# /importer:FontDescriptionImporter
# /processor:FontDescriptionProcessor
# /processorParam:TextureFormat=Compressed
# /build:Fonts/Regular.spritefont
# /build:Fonts/Bold.spritefont
# /build:Fonts/Display.spritefont
